{"id": "33964", "title": "潮声", "author": "琼瑶", "category": "文学名著", "count": 17, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33964.htm", "intro": "在冬天，听潮楼盛满了萧瑟和寂寥，假如你不嫌海风的凌厉和午夜涛声的激荡，又忍受得了那份寂寞，就不妨迁去小住……。黑眸、苔痕、木偶、谜、潮声……本书收集十七篇中、短篇小说，每篇都娓述着一个动人的故事……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33964", "chapters": [{"title": "一、桥", "file": "2160107.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二、黑眸", "file": "2160108.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三、美美", "file": "2160109.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四、一颗星", "file": "2160110.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五、复仇", "file": "2160111.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六、苔痕", "file": "2160112.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七、婚事", "file": "2160113.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八、尤加利树·雨滴·梦", "file": "2160114.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九、网", "file": "2160115.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十、落魄", "file": "2160116.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十一、起站与终站", "file": "2160117.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十二、石榴花瓶", "file": "2160118.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十三、终身大事", "file": "2160119.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十四、深山里", "file": "2160120.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十五、木偶", "file": "2160121.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十六、谜", "file": "2160122.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十七、潮声", "file": "2160123.html", "available": false}]}